msgid ""
"Normalized pixel size of the default 2D texture. For a Sprite2D with a "
"texture of size 64×32 pixels, ``TEXTURE_PIXEL_SIZE`` = ``vec2(1.0 / 64.0, "
"1.0 / 32.0)``."
msgstr ""
"Taille de pixel normalisée de la texture 2D par défaut. Pour un Sprite2D "
"d'une résolution de 64x32px, ``TEXTURE_PIXEL_SIZE`` = ``vec2(1.0 / 64.0, "
"1.0 / 32.0)``."

